      "value": "@{638db6a05eadfa39b5a00db2|full_name} i feel that since you can have players muted if they are visitors, the same should be applicable to the textbox. i know muting people's voices used to mute textbox as well. but if i have all visitors voice muted so i don't get harassed they could just type slurs at me instead lol. needing to mute individually for a group i don't want to hear is very inefficient.",
